{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d555962b030f8b57f8d51f78a5b0f13bb3624a6c19c886ebc7fe3d28a836fb76",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_a:2_4_029_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4551ae0da49585b077255c9b2c2edff9c43594d2ecf7d24ec0ae04c475587e1f",
      "text": "吾主啊。将我深藏的觉醒姿态\n展现给同胞团之人，可是汝？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_a:2_4_029_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63520cd7e6941f52f326d7fc7f15d9ebfbb9eae66bac6bdb0aef12e95b466d61",
      "text": "众人无一例外，似皆为我的姿态以及我等收入掌中的\n绝景所释放的魔力所震撼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_a:2_4_029_02_09_a:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4947440fc61aac69761e88457e5be6ff7cdd464df0c857cd81022a6df04df3dc",
      "text": "因为想让更多人\n看到",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_a:2_4_029_02_09_a:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65d0a781d8deefeebc7eed5c8082b058e14084248286d52ff72e81e39b1d22c7",
      "text": "我觉得那是张凝聚了\n魅力的照片",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_a:2_4_029_02_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1c00994eff0c57454a3698713d8f16f55a48235852369252e07898292e821c9",
      "text": "意图将身为撒旦仆从的我之力量广而告之吗……\n不愧是吾主，妙计！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_a:2_4_029_02_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49f9e83ceeec76b55b3cda66cae27991f6d980f485e230ce59f584a053df5179",
      "text": "库库……！毕竟解放了被封印的力量，\n其威能难以估量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_a:2_4_029_02_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee682ec73fc317112093167f39bdd4442af1805a1b1790315b24dab5c804b041",
      "text": "我与同胞团约定好，为了一同将那黄金沙上的\n城池掌握于手中，必将故地重游。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_a:2_4_029_02_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b604fedfad1601fe44319840d1bb526d6067b32b652fe4098a010a9818c8831",
      "text": "届时，也定要再次挑战那包罗猩红果肉的宝玉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_a:2_4_029_02_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf911458594c5dd72e36d7fa7419d1ec29b20b3aff63c4336a236a1f05d429da",
      "text": "光之子民定然也同样\n对该地抱有向往之情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_a:2_4_029_02_09_a:cmd-000029:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c33ce3f0a0e1777ba07a8650745e01d194d8cd08a0e6bbb0701e3506e2adc7be",
      "text": "喜欢沙滩\n吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_a:2_4_029_02_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a2776c1dcecd2d45ed14a61a0c47349303c186e77c2797f77c9f1d829bb74e9",
      "text": "该地的光景，不可思议地增幅着魔力……\n乃是能令撒旦亦为之激昂的魅力之地。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_a:2_4_029_02_09_a:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fab2378cac196f51f01f57bc42a70d87bae414e082bf2aa3178b660e6d2c1e5c",
      "text": "那么，我须得与同胞团一同，思索掌握\n沙上城池的法门了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_a:2_4_029_02_09_a:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e16d941235a80a2e3b48e977a2ca7c0dbc4ebdcb1684359554225f1e7bd32c61",
      "text": "待世界再次被黑暗包围之时再会吧。\n永别了，吾主啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
